(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DFA},\\mathrm{NFA},\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{DFA},\\mathrm{NFA},\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\\)</span> 及其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"222bbfa3171233c2\" href=\"?note=222bbfa3171233c2\" title=\"73-df-nfa-notation\">73-df-nfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"52ddba8829989be5\" href=\"?note=52ddba8829989be5\" title=\"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"a33552223dc0fdf0\" href=\"?note=a33552223dc0fdf0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"4ffa4d7b72a6a19e\" href=\"?note=4ffa4d7b72a6a19e\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-acceptance-notation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(E)\">\\(L(E)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"adc84a4e20d398f2\" href=\"?note=adc84a4e20d398f2\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-algebra\">73-df-regular-language-algebra</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"a3e9105500b60a59\" href=\"?note=a3e9105500b60a59\" title=\"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map\">73-df-regular-algebra-language-map</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\text{-}\\mathrm{NFA}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\text{-}\\mathrm{NFA}\\)</span> 的兼容定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"a33552223dc0fdf0\" href=\"?note=a33552223dc0fdf0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{REGULAR}&amp;=\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\{L(E):E\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{REGULAR}&amp;=\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\{L(E):E\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式定义类，后续等式是自动机等价及有限代数生成的性质。它们不再通过原来互相引用的未定义机器类形成依赖环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation"